like Transformers and Sentence Transformers

60
00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:54.600
Sklearn metrics and numpy, because we're
going to end up using a bunch of these

61
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:58.500
foreign named entity extraction and vector
similarity computation.

62
00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.733
And then separately, we're

63
00:02:59.733 --> 00:03:03.300
also going to initialize
