64
00:03:03.633 --> 00:03:07.300
We are going to use a simple Bert base
tokenizer and

65
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.500
model that we're going to use as

66
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.500
part of our NER
or named entity recognition pipeline.

67
00:03:12.533 --> 00:03:13.400
Awesome. All right.

